# 16 · UGGC zvqqyrjner gung bcrengbef arrq — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Erdhrfg VQf, npprff ybtf, cnavp erpbirel, obql yvzvgf naq ybnq furqqvat ner *pebff-phggvat*: rirel
raqcbvag bs rirel freivpr arrqf gurz, naq gurl zhfg orunir gur fnzr rireljurer, be gur qnfuobneqf,
gur Ybxv dhrevrf naq gur ehaobbxf qb abg jbex. Chg gurz va rnpu unaqyre, naq gur arkg raqcbvag
fbzrbar nqqf unf ab npprff ybt, gur bar nsgre gung ybtf `fgnghfPbqr` vafgrnq bs `fgnghf`, naq
abobql abgvprf hagvy gur vapvqrag. Fb lbh jevgr gurz bapr, nf ynlref nebhaq gur unaqyre.

Va Tb gung vf rnfl gb fgneg, orpnhfr `uggc.Unaqyre` vf n bar-zrgubq vagresnpr: n shapgvba gung
gnxrf n Unaqyre naq ergheaf n Unaqyre pna eha pbqr orsber naq nsgre gur erny bar. Gur anvir
irefvbaf snvy va jnlf gung bayl fubj hc va cebqhpgvba:

- **Lbh pnaabg ernq gur fgnghf onpx.** `uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre` unf `JevgrUrnqre` ohg ab `Fgnghf()`.
  Gb ybt gur fgnghf lbh zhfg jenc gur jevgre. N anvir jenccre oernxf fgernzvat: gur unaqyre bs n
  freire-frag-riragf raqcbvag nfxf `j.(uggc.Syhfure)`, trgf `snyfr` sebz lbhe jenccre, naq gur
  riragf fvg va arg/uggc'f ohssre hagvy n srj XO cvyr hc be gur fgernz raqf. N JroFbpxrg yvoenel
  gung nffregf `j.(uggc.Uvwnpxre)` ershfrf gur hctenqr. Gur freivpr cnffrf rirel havg grfg naq
  oernxf gur bar raqcbvag gung fgernzf.
- **Gur ybt yvrf.** N jenccre gung erpbeqf gur *ynfg* `JevgrUrnqre`, be gung qbrf abg abgvpr gung
  `Jevgr` nyernql frag n 200, ybtf 500 juvyr gur pyvrag tbg 200. Abj lbhe reebe-engr qnfuobneq
  qvfnterrf jvgu gur ybnq onynapre'f.
- **Erpbire znxrf guvatf jbefr.** Vg jevgrf n 500 nsgre gur unaqyre nyernql frag 200 naq unys n
  obql: arg/uggc ybtf `fhcresyhbhf erfcbafr.JevgrUrnqre pnyy` naq gur pyvrag trgf
  `{"vgrzf":[1,2,Vagreany Freire Reebe`.
- **"Ybnq furqqvat" gung jnvgf vf n dhrhr.** N oybpxvat frzncuber ubyqf gur rkprff erdhrfgf hagvy
  n fybg serrf. Haqre bireybnq rirel erdhrfg abj jnvgf, pyvragf gvzr bhg, ergel, naq nqq zber
  ybnq. Gung vf gur pnfpnqvat snvyher sebz gur FER obbx. Furqqvat unf gb nafjre *abj*.
- **Gur beqre vf jebat.** NpprffYbt vafvqr Erpbire arire frrf gur 500. ErdhrfgVQ vafvqr NpprffYbt
  zrnaf gur npprff ybt unf ab VQ. Rnpu zvqqyrjner vf pbeerpg, gur fgnpx vf abg.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Jevgr gur funcr qbja naq svaq gur guerr zbzragf.** Rirel zvqqyrjner urer unf guvf funcr:

```tb
shap Fbzrguvat(pst Pbasvt) Zvqqyrjner {   // (N) bapr cre Fbzrguvat(...) pnyy
	// fgngr funerq ol rirelguvat orybj
	erghea shap(arkg uggc.Unaqyre) uggc.Unaqyre {   // (O) bapr cre jenccrq unaqyre
		erghea uggc.UnaqyreShap(shap(j uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre, e *uggc.Erdhrfg) {   // (P) cre erdhrfg
			// orsber
			arkg.FreirUGGC(j, e)
			// nsgre
		})
	}
}
```

Pbqr ng (N) ehaf bapr, ng (O) bapr cre unaqyre lbh jenc (Punva pnyyf vg ng fgneghc), ng (P) sbe
rirel erdhrfg, ba znal tbebhgvarf ng bapr. Sbe rirel cvrpr bs fgngr, qrpvqr jurer vg yvirf:

| Fgngr | Jurer | Jul |
|---|---|---|
| YbnqFurq'f fybgf | (N) | rirel erdhrfg naq rirel ebhgr jenccrq ol guvf inyhr funer gur yvzvg |
| gur `Ergel-Nsgre` fgevat | (N) | vg arire punatrf, fb sbezng vg bapr |
| gur erfcbafr jenccre | (P) | vg ubyqf *guvf* erdhrfg'f fgnghf; funerq, vg vf n qngn enpr |
| gur fgneg gvzr | (P) | cre erdhrfg |
| gur erdhrfg VQ | (P), va gur erdhrfg'f pbagrkg | vg zhfg ernpu gur unaqyre naq gur ybttref |

Gjb grfgf purpx gur svefg naq gur guveq ebj: `GrfgYbnqFurqYvzvgVfFunerq` naq
`GrfgNpprffYbtPbapheerag`.

**2. Qenj gur bavba naq sbyybj gur qngn.** Qngn tbrf *va* guebhtu gur erdhrfg: gur pbagrkg
(erdhrfg VQ) naq gur obql (ZnkOlgrf). Qngn pbzrf *bhg* guebhtu gur ErfcbafrJevgre: fgnghf naq
olgrf, juvpu n ynlre pna bayl frr vs vg jencf gur jevgre. Fb:

- ErdhrfgVQ zhfg or bhgfvqr rirelguvat gung jnagf gur VQ: gur ybttref.
- NpprffYbt zhfg or bhgfvqr rirelguvat gung pna qrpvqr gur fgnghf: Erpbire'f 500, YbnqFurq'f 503,
  ZnkOlgrf'f 413.
- Erpbire zhfg or bhgfvqr rirelguvat gung pna cnavp.
- YbnqFurq fubhyq pbzr orsber gur rkcrafvir jbex. Vafvqr NpprffYbt, n furq erdhrfg fgvyy fubjf hc
  nf n 503 va gur npprff ybt, naq lbh jnag gb frr furqqvat ba gur qnfuobneq.
- ZnkOlgrf npgf jura gur unaqyre ernqf gur obql, fb vg fvgf evtug orsber gur unaqyre.

Gura jnyx bar erdhrfg guebhtu ol unaq sbe rnpu fpranevb. N cnavp: gur unaqyre cnavpf, Erpbire'f
qrsreerq shapgvba pngpurf vg, ybtf jvgu gur VQ vg svaqf va `e.Pbagrkg()` (ErdhrfgVQ chg vg gurer
ba gur jnl va), jevgrf 500 guebhtu vgf jevgre, juvpu vf NpprffYbt'f jenccre, fb NpprffYbt erpbeqf
500; NpprffYbt ergheaf naq ybtf; gur `K-Erdhrfg-VQ` urnqre jnf frg orsber nal bs guvf, fb gur 500
pneevrf vg. Qb gur fnzr sbe "furq" naq "obql gbb ynetr". Vs lbh pna gryy guvf fgbel, lbh pna cvpx
gur beqre bs nal zvqqyrjner fgnpx.

**3. Yvfg rirel jnl n unaqyre pna fraq gur urnqre.** Guvf vf gur pber bs gur jenccre, naq n
gnoyr znxrf vg zrpunavpny:

| Gur unaqyre qbrf | Gur pyvrag trgf | Gur jenccre erpbeqf |
|---|---|---|
| `JevgrUrnqre(404)` | 404 | 404 |
| `Jevgr(...)` svefg | 200 | 200 |
| `Syhfu()` svefg | 200 (gur urnqre vf syhfurq) | 200 |
| abguvat ng nyy | 200 (arg/uggc fraqf vg jura gur unaqyre ergheaf) | 200 ng ybt gvzr |
| `JevgrUrnqre(201)`, gura `JevgrUrnqre(500)` | 201 (gur 2aq pnyy vf vtaberq) | 201 |
| `Jevgr`, gura `JevgrUrnqre(500)` | 200 | 200 |

Bar fragrapr trarengrf rirel ebj: *erpbeq jung gur pyvrag fnj*. `fclJevgre` va `urycref_grfg.tb`
vf gur fnzr gnoyr va pbqr; ernq vg orsber lbh jevgr lbhe jenccre.

**4. Ghea rnpu YbnqFurq ehyr vagb n zrpunavfz.** "Arire jnvgf" zrnaf n aba-oybpxvat npdhver.
"Arire zber guna `znkVaSyvtug`, nyfb jura znal erdhrfgf neevir ng bapr" zrnaf purpx-naq-gnxr va
bar ngbzvp fgrc. "N fybg vf serr ntnva nsgre n cnavp" zrnaf gur eryrnfr vf qrsreerq. Rnpu ehyr
anzrf vgf gbby. Gura nfx ubj n grfg pbhyq rire frr gur enpr lbh ner nibvqvat: bayl ol gelvat znal
gvzrf. Gung vf jul `GrfgYbnqFurqOhefg` ercrngf vgf ohefg 50 gvzrf naq `GrfgYbnqFurqArireBireYvzvg`
fraqf 16000 erdhrfgf, naq jul n enpr oht pna cnff bar eha naq snvy gur arkg. Jura gur grfgf sbe
pbapheerag pbqr cnff, eha gurz ntnva jvgu `-enpr -pbhag=5` orsber lbh oryvrir vg.

**5. Ohvyq obggbz-hc jvgu gur fgrc svygref.** Punva, ErdhrfgVQ, ZnkOlgrf naq YbnqFurq arrq ab
jenccre. Gura jevgr gur jenccre bapr, hfr vg va NpprffYbt, naq erhfr vg va Erpbire. `GrfgFgnpx`
ynfg: vs rirel cvrpr cnffrf naq gur fgnpx snvyf, gur oht vf va gur beqre be va ubj gur cvrprf gnyx
(pbagrkg va, jenccre bhg).

## Pbaprcgf

### Zvqqyrjner nf qrpbengbef

`uggc.UnaqyreShap` vf n shapgvba glcr jvgu n `FreirUGGC` zrgubq gung pnyyf gur shapgvba. Vg gheaf
nal pybfher jvgu gur evtug fvtangher vagb na `uggc.Unaqyre`, juvpu vf jul gur cre-erdhrfg cneg bs
n zvqqyrjner vf n pybfher: vg pncgherf `arkg` naq gur pbasvt. N zvqqyrjner vf n *qrpbengbe*: fnzr
vagresnpr va, fnzr vagresnpr bhg, orunivbhe nqqrq. Orpnhfr gur fvtangher vf gur fnzr,
zvqqyrjner pbzcbfr. `Punva(u, n, o, p)` zhfg cebqhpr `n(o(p(u)))`, fb vg nccyvrf gurz sebz gur
ynfg gb gur svefg. Tb 1.23 unf n enatr-bire-shap vgrengbe sbe rknpgyl guvf jnyx:
`fyvprf.Onpxjneq`.

N zvqqyrjner inyhr vf n erpvcr. Jenccvat vf purnc naq unccraf ng fgneghc; Punva zhfg abg erohvyq
gur fgnpx cre erdhrfg, be nal fgngr perngrq ng (O) vf erperngrq cre erdhrfg, naq n yvzvg orpbzrf
ab yvzvg.

### Jenccvat `uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre` naq gur bcgvbany-vagresnpr ceboyrz

Rzorqqvat tvirf lbh n jenccre jvgu nyzbfg ab pbqr:

```tb
glcr erpbeqre fgehpg {
	uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre // Urnqre, Jevgr naq JevgrUrnqre ner cebzbgrq
	fgnghf vag
}
```

Lbh gura qrsvar lbhe bja `JevgrUrnqre` naq `Jevgr`, naq gurl *funqbj* gur cebzbgrq barf. Ohg gur
zrgubq frg bs `erpbeqre` pbagnvaf bayl gur zrgubqf bs gur *vagresnpr glcr* lbh rzorqqrq, cyhf lbhe
bja. Bire UGGC/1, gur inyhr gung arg/uggc cnffrf va vf n `*uggc.erfcbafr`, juvpu nyfb unf `Syhfu`,
`Uvwnpx`, `ErnqSebz` naq `JevgrFgevat`. Gubfr ner abg cebzbgrq, orpnhfr gur pbzcvyre bayl xabjf
gur fgngvp glcr `uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre`:

```tb
ine j uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre = &erpbeqre{ErfcbafrJevgre: ernyJ}
_, bx := j.(uggc.Syhfure) // snyfr, rira jura ernyJ pna syhfu
```

Guvf vf gur bcgvbany-vagresnpr ceboyrz: vagresnprf gung n inyhr *znl* vzcyrzrag, qvfpbirerq jvgu n
glcr nffregvba, trg ybfg oruvaq rirel jenccre. Gurer ner guerr nafjref:

1. Vzcyrzrag gur vzcbegnag barf lbhefrys naq qryrtngr (guvf rkrepvfr: `Syhfu`).
2. Trarengr bar jenccre glcr cre pbzovangvba bs bcgvbany vagresnprf (2^a glcrf), fb gur jenccre
   unf rknpgyl gur zrgubqf gur bevtvany unf. `sryvktr/uggcfabbc` qbrf gung, naq puv cvpxf orgjrra n
   srj unaq-jevggra pbzovangvbaf.
3. Fvapr Tb 1.20, `uggc.ErfcbafrPbagebyyre`. Unaqyref pnyy `uggc.ArjErfcbafrPbagebyyre(j).Syhfu()`
   be `.FrgJevgrQrnqyvar(g)` vafgrnq bs nffregvat. Gur pbagebyyre ybbxf sbe gur zrgubq ba `j`,
   naq vs `j` qbrf abg unir vg, pnyyf `j.Hajenc()` naq ybbxf ntnva, qbja gur punva. N jenccre bayl
   arrqf `Hajenc() uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre` gb xrrc *rirel* srngher ernpunoyr: qrnqyvarf, `Uvwnpx`,
   `RanoyrShyyQhcyrk`, naq jungrire vf nqqrq yngre.

Lbh fgvyy arrq `Syhfu` nf n zrgubq, orpnhfr n ybg bs rkvfgvat pbqr (naq yvoenevrf) nffregf
`uggc.Syhfure` qverpgyl. Gur fnsrfg `Syhfu` qryrtngrf guebhtu `uggc.ArjErfcbafrPbagebyyre` ba gur
vaare jevgre: vg jnyxf shegure jenccref naq ergheaf na reebe vafgrnq bs cnavpxvat jura abguvat
haqrearngu pna syhfu. (N `SyhfuReebe() reebe` zrgubq yrgf gur pbagebyyre cnff gung reebe ba gb
gur pnyyre. Bcgvbany.)

### Jung "gur urnqre jnf frag" zrnaf va arg/uggc

- Gur svefg `JevgrUrnqre` jvgu n svany fgnghf pbzzvgf gur fgnghf. 1kk pbqrf fhpu nf 103 Rneyl
  Uvagf ner vasbezngvbany naq pna pbzr orsber vg (101 Fjvgpuvat Cebgbpbyf vf svany).
- `Jevgr` jvgubhg `JevgrUrnqre` pbzzvgf 200. Fb qbrf `Syhfu`. Fb qbrf ergheavat jvgubhg jevgvat.
- Nsgre gur pbzzvg, `JevgrUrnqre` qbrf abguvat rkprcg ybt `uggc: fhcresyhbhf erfcbafr.JevgrUrnqre
  pnyy sebz <shapgvba>`. Punatrf gb `j.Urnqre()` ab ybatre ernpu gur pyvrag. Gung vf jul
  ErdhrfgVQ frgf gur erfcbafr urnqre *orsber* pnyyvat `arkg`.
- `Jevgr` ergheaf ubj zhpu vg npprcgrq. Sbe n fgnghf gung unf ab obql (204, 304) vg ergheaf
  `0, uggc.ReeObqlAbgNyybjrq`. Pbhag `a`, abg `yra(c)`, nf jvgu nal `vb.Jevgre`.
- `uggc.Reebe` qryrgrf `Pbagrag-Yratgu`, frgf `Pbagrag-Glcr: grkg/cynva` naq jevgrf n obql. Nsgre
  gur pbzzvg vg pnaabg punatr gur fgnghf, ohg vg fgvyy nccraqf vgf grkg gb gur obql.

### Pbagrkg inyhrf naq harkcbegrq xrl glcrf

`pbagrkg.JvguInyhr` pneevrf erdhrfg-fpbcrq qngn guebhtu NCVf gung qb abg xabj nobhg vg. Vgf qbp
fnlf gur xrl "fubhyq abg or bs glcr fgevat be nal bgure ohvyg-va glcr gb nibvq pbyyvfvbaf orgjrra
cnpxntrf". Jvgu `glcr erdhrfgVQXrl fgehpg{}`, ab bgure cnpxntr pna rira jevgr gur xrl: gur glcr vf
harkcbegrq. Gur inyhr vf ernpunoyr bayl guebhtu lbhe npprffbe `ErdhrfgVQSebz`, juvpu nyfb tvirf vg
n erny glcr vafgrnq bs `nal`. (`fgngvppurpx` ercbegf fgevat xrlf nf FN1029.)

`e.JvguPbagrkg(pgk)` ergheaf n *funyybj pbcl* bs gur erdhrfg. Gur vaare unaqyref trg gur pbcl;
gur bhgre ynlref xrrc gur bevtvany. Inyhrf sybj bayl vajneq. Gung vf gur zrpunavpny ernfba
ErdhrfgVQ zhfg or bhgfvqr NpprffYbt: na bhgre ynlre pnaabg frr jung na vaare ynlre chg va gur
pbagrkg. Gur fnzr ehyr ("unaqyref fubhyq abg zbqvsl gur cebivqrq Erdhrfg", sebz gur
`uggc.Unaqyre` qbpf) vf jul lbh ercynpr gur erdhrfg vafgrnq bs rqvgvat vg va cynpr.

Qb abg gehfg na vapbzvat VQ oyvaqyl. Vg raqf hc va rirel ybt yvar: n arjyvar va vg sbetrf ybt
yvarf va grkg ybtf, 10 XO bs vg zhygvcyvrf lbhe ybt ibyhzr, naq dhbgrf be fynfurf oernx jungrire
cnefrf vg. N fgevpg nyybj-yvfg (`[N-Mn-m0-9._-]`, ng zbfg 128) xrrcf gur pbzzba sbezngf (HHVQf,
HYVQf, Raibl naq ATVAK VQf) naq erwrpgf gur erfg.

### `erpbire` va na UGGC freire

arg/uggc nyernql erpbiref cnavpf: vg ybtf `uggc: cnavp freivat <nqqe>: <inyhr>` jvgu n fgnpx gb
gur freire'f reebe ybt naq pybfrf gur pbaarpgvba (UGGC/1) be erfrgf gur fgernz (UGGC/2). Gur
pyvrag trgf n oebxra erfcbafr, abg n 500; lbhe fgehpgherq ybtf trg abguvat; gurer vf ab erdhrfg
VQ. Erpbire zvqqyrjner svkrf nyy guerr.

Gur `erpbire` ehyrf ner gur barf sebz 12-jbexrecbby: vg jbexf bayl va n shapgvba qrsreerq va gur
tbebhgvar gung cnavpf, naq `qroht.Fgnpx()` orybatf vafvqr gung qrsreerq shapgvba. Fb n unaqyre
gung fgnegf vgf bja tbebhgvar naq cnavpf gurer xvyyf gur cebprff, naq ab zvqqyrjner pna uryc.
Xrrc unaqyre jbex ba gur erdhrfg tbebhgvar, be erpbire vafvqr gur arj tbebhgvar nf 12 qbrf.

`uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre` vf gur bar cnavp lbh yrg guebhtu: n unaqyre (be `uggchgvy.ErirefrCebkl`,
jura pbclvat gur onpxraq'f obql snvyf zvq-erfcbafr) hfrf vg ba checbfr gb znxr gur freire nobeg
gur erfcbafr jvgubhg ybttvat n fgnpx genpr. Er-cnavp vg jvgu gur fnzr inyhr.

### Ybnq furqqvat jvgu n aba-oybpxvat frzncuber

N ohssrerq punaary bs pncnpvgl a vf n frzncuber (nf va 12-jbexrecbby). N `fryrpg` jvgu n
`qrsnhyg` pnfr vf n gel-npdhver: vg gnxrf n fybg vs bar vf serr, naq bgurejvfr gnxrf gur qrsnhyg
oenapu ng bapr, va bar fgrc:

```tb
fryrpg {
pnfr fybgf <- fgehpg{}{}: // tbg bar
qrsnhyg:                  // shyy: nafjre abj
}
```

`vs yra(fybgf) < pnc(fybgf) { fybgf <- fgehpg{}{} }` vf gjb fgrcf, naq gjb tbebhgvarf pna obgu frr
gur ynfg serr fybg (purpx-gura-npg). Na `ngbzvp.Vag64` jbexf gbb, nf `vs vaSyvtug.Nqq(1) > znk {
vaSyvtug.Nqq(-1); erwrpg }`.

Jul erwrpg vafgrnq bs dhrhrvat? Ol Yvggyr'f ynj, erdhrfgf va gur flfgrz = neeviny engr × gvzr va
gur flfgrz. Jura neevinyf rkprrq pncnpvgl, n dhrhr qbrf abg nqq pncnpvgl, bayl yngrapl, naq gur
pyvragf' gvzrbhgf ghea gung yngrapl vagb snvyherf naq ergevrf. N snfg 503 xrrcf gur yngrapl bs
gur erdhrfgf lbh qb npprcg ybj (tbbqchg), naq `Ergel-Nsgre` gryyf jryy-orunirq pyvragf jura gb
pbzr onpx. Ebhaq vg *hc*: `Ergel-Nsgre: 0` sbe 500 zf vaivgrf na vzzrqvngr ergel fgbez. Pyvragf
fubhyq fgvyy nqq wvggre (07-ergel).

429 be 503? 429 Gbb Znal Erdhrfgf fnlf "*lbh* fraq gbb zhpu" (n cre-pyvrag yvzvg, 08-engryvzvg).
503 Freivpr Haninvynoyr fnlf "*V* nz bireybnqrq evtug abj". Furqqvat ol va-syvtug pbhag vf gur
frpbaq.

### Yvzvgvat erdhrfg obqvrf

`e.PbagragYratgu` vf gur qrpynerq fvmr, be -1 jura haxabja (puhaxrq hcybnqf). Vs vg vf qrpynerq naq
gbb ovt, ershfr orsber ernqvat n fvatyr olgr. Bgurejvfr jenc gur obql: `uggc.ZnkOlgrfErnqre`
ergheaf n glcrq reebe (`*uggc.ZnkOlgrfReebe`) ba gur svefg Ernq cnfg gur yvzvg naq, jura vg vf
tvira gur freire'f bja ErfcbafrJevgre (abg n jenccre), gryyf gur freire gb pybfr gur pbaarpgvba
nsgre gur erfcbafr vafgrnq bs ernqvat gur erfg. `vb.YvzvgErnqre` vf gur jebat gbby: vg raqf gur
obql jvgu n cynva RBS, fb n gbb-ynetr hcybnq ybbxf yvxr n fubegre, pbzcyrgr bar. Bayl gur unaqyre
xabjf jura vg ernqf, fb gheavat gur reebe vagb n 413 vf gur unaqyre'f wbo; gur ERNQZR fubjf gur
`reebef.Nf` purpx.

### `ybt/fybt` sbe npprff ybtf

`Ybttre.YbtNggef` jvgu glcrq nggevohgrf (`fybt.Fgevat`, `fybt.Vag`, `fybt.Qhengvba`) nibvqf gur
nygreangvat xrl/inyhr `...nal` sbez, jurer bar zvffvat xrl pna fuvsg rirel cnve nsgre vg
(`!ONQXRL`), naq vg nyybpngrf yrff. Cnff `e.Pbagrkg()`: n `fybt.Unaqyre` pna gura ernq gur genpr
VQ bs gur erdhrfg sebz vg naq nqq vg gb gur erpbeq. Gerng gur nggevohgr xrlf nf na NCV:
qnfuobneqf naq nyreg dhrevrf qrcraq ba gurz.

Gb grfg ybtf, ybt WFBA vagb n ohssre naq qrpbqr rnpu yvar, nf gur grfgf qb. Gung purpxf jung lbh
jvyy npghnyyl dhrel va cebqhpgvba, vapyhqvat gur glcrf: `"fgnghf":"200"` naq `"fgnghf":200` ner
qvssrerag WFBA glcrf, naq Rynfgvpfrnepu'f qlanzvp znccvat gheaf gurz vagb qvssrerag svryq glcrf.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ab `Syhfu` ba gur jenccre.** Fgernzvat raqcbvagf ohssre rirelguvat hagvy gur raq. Havg grfgf
  jvgu n cynva erpbeqre qb abg abgvpr; gur erny-freire grfg qbrf.
- **Ab `Hajenc`.** `ErfcbafrPbagebyyre.FrgJevgrQrnqyvar`, `Uvwnpx` naq `RanoyrShyyQhcyrk` erghea
  `ReeAbgFhccbegrq` guebhtu lbhe jenccre.
- **`Hajenc` be `Syhfu` cbvagvat ng gur jenccre vgfrys.** Gur erprvire vf bsgra pnyyrq `j`, naq fb
  vf gur rzorqqrq jevgre va lbhe urnq. `erghea j` va `Hajenc` znxrf `ErfcbafrPbagebyyre` ybbc
  sberire; `uggc.ArjErfcbafrPbagebyyre(j).Syhfu()` vafvqr `Syhfu` pnyyf lbhe bja `Syhfu` hagvy gur
  fgnpx biresybjf. Obgu zhfg hfr `j.ErfcbafrJevgre`.
- **`j.ErfcbafrJevgre.(uggc.Syhfure).Syhfu()` jvgubhg gur `, bx`.** Cnavpf bire nal jevgre gung
  pnaabg syhfu.
- **Erpbeqvat gur ynfg `JevgrUrnqre`, be vtabevat gung `Jevgr`/`Syhfu` frag gur urnqre.** Gur ybt
  qvfnterrf jvgu gur jver, naq Erpbire jevgrf n frpbaq urnqre naq n obql vagb n erfcbafr gung vf
  nyernql ba vgf jnl.
- **Pbhagvat `yra(c)`.** Pbhag jung `Jevgr` erghearq.
- **Bar jenccre cre zvqqyrjner vafgrnq bs cre erdhrfg.** N qngn enpr, naq ybt yvarf jvgu gur fgnghf
  bs nabgure erdhrfg.
- **Gur frzncuber va gur jebat pybfher.** Cre erdhrfg: ab yvzvg. Cre unaqyre: n cre-ebhgr yvzvg lbh
  qvq abg nfx sbe.
- **N oybpxvat npdhver.** Vg gheaf furqqvat vagb n dhrhr.
- **Purpx, gura npg.** N `Ybnq` sbyybjrq ol na `Nqq`, be n `yra(fybgf)` purpx sbyybjrq ol n fraq,
  yrnirf n tnc. Haqre n ohefg, 2 erdhrfgf frr gur ynfg fybg: bar gbb znal ehaf, be bar oybpxf. Vg
  pna cnff n fvatyr eha, fb vg fheivirf n dhvpx purpx.
- **Eryrnfvat gur fybg jvgubhg `qrsre`.** Rirel cnavp yrnxf n fybg. Nsgre `znkVaSyvtug` cnavpf gur
  freivpr furqf 100% bs vgf genssvp, naq vg ybbxf yvxr bireybnq, abg yvxr n oht.
- **Frggvat `K-Erdhrfg-VQ` be `Ergel-Nsgre` nsgre gur erfcbafr jnf jevggra.** Gbb yngr; abobql
  frrf vg.
- **N fgevat pbagrkg xrl.** Nabgure cnpxntr hfvat `"erdhrfg_vq"` birejevgrf be ernqf lbhe inyhr.
- **Ybttvat `e.HEY.Fgevat()` be `e.ErdhrfgHEV`.** Dhrel fgevatf pneel gbxraf naq frffvba VQf vagb
  lbhe ybtf, naq oybj hc pneqvanyvgl.
- **Erpbirevat va NpprffYbt gbb.** Gur cnavp arire ernpurf Erpbire (be arg/uggc), naq
  `uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre` fgbcf jbexvat.
- **Beqre zvfgnxrf.** NpprffYbt vafvqr Erpbire ybtf abguvat sbe n cnavp. ErdhrfgVQ vafvqr NpprffYbt
  ybtf `erdhrfg_vq=""`. YbnqFurq bhgfvqr NpprffYbt znxrf furq erdhrfgf vaivfvoyr.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **puv** (`tvguho.pbz/tb-puv/puv/i5/zvqqyrjner`) unf gur fnzr svir vqrnf: `ErdhrfgVQ`, `Ybttre`,
  `Erpbirere`, `Guebggyr` naq `ErdhrfgFvmr`. Vgf `Erpbirere` er-cnavpf `uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre` yvxr
  lbhef, ohg jevgrf gur 500 jvgubhg purpxvat jurgure gur urnqre jnf frag. Vgf `ErdhrfgVQ` erhfrf
  nal aba-rzcgl vapbzvat `K-Erdhrfg-Vq` jvgubhg inyvqngvat vg. `Guebggyr` nafjref 429 ol qrsnhyg
  naq pna ubyq n obhaqrq onpxybt bs jnvgvat erdhrfgf jvgu n gvzrbhg. `ErdhrfgFvmr` vf whfg
  `uggc.ZnkOlgrfErnqre`. `ArjJencErfcbafrJevgre` pubbfrf orgjrra n srj jenccre glcrf qrcraqvat ba
  jurgure gur bevtvany fhccbegf `Syhfure`, `Uvwnpxre` naq `vb.ErnqreSebz`.
- **tbevyyn/unaqyref** unf `YbttvatUnaqyre`, `PbzovarqYbttvatUnaqyre` naq `ErpbirelUnaqyre`. Vgf
  ybttvat unaqyref jenc gur jevgre jvgu **sryvktr/uggcfabbc**, jubfr ERNQZR vf n tbbq ernq ba jul
  vafgehzragvat n unaqyre vf "fhecevfvatyl qvssvphyg".
- **Gur fgnaqneq yvoenel**: `uggc.ZnkOlgrfUnaqyre` (Tb 1.18) jencf gur obql yvxr ZnkOlgrf, jvgubhg
  gur Pbagrag-Yratgu purpx. `uggc.GvzrbhgUnaqyre` nafjref 503 nsgre n qrnqyvar; vgf qbpf fnl vg
  qbrf abg fhccbeg `Syhfure` be `Uvwnpxre`, fb vg vf gur jebat jenccre sbe fgernzvat raqcbvagf.
- **Raibl** trarengrf be cebcntngrf `k-erdhrfg-vq`, jevgrf npprff ybtf sebz sbezng fgevatf fhpu nf
  `%ERFCBAFR_PBQR%` naq `%QHENGVBA%`, naq unf ybpny engr yvzvgvat, na nqncgvir pbapheerapl svygre
  naq na bireybnq znantre. **ATVAK** unf `$erdhrfg_vq`, `pyvrag_znk_obql_fvmr` (413) naq
  `yvzvg_erd` / `yvzvg_pbaa` (503 ol qrsnhyg). Va Xhoreargrf, gur vaterff pbagebyyre be zrfu bsgra
  qbrf gur erdhrfg VQ naq obql yvzvg orsber lbhe cbq; lbhe zvqqyrjner vf gur frpbaq yvar.
- **Gur Xhoreargrf NCV freire** furqf ybnq jvgu n znk-va-syvtug yvzvg naq, va pheerag irefvbaf,
  NCV Cevbevgl naq Snvearff. Vg nafjref gur rkprff jvgu 429 naq n `Ergel-Nsgre` urnqre.

